  "prefLabel": "Ac 303.01 Initial CPA Applicant Qualifications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 303.01 Initial CPA Applicant Qualifications. To be granted initial certification, CPA applicants shall meet or exceed the minimum qualifications relative to:\n\n(a) Education as set forth in RSA 309-B:5, III, and Ac 303.02;\n\n(b) Experience as set forth in RSA 309-B:5, IX or X, and Ac 303.04;\n\n(c) Examination as set forth in RSA 309-B:5, IV through VI, and Ac 304.02; and\n\n(d) Good character as set forth in RSA 309-B:5, II.\n\nSource. #14399, eff 12-5-25, EXPIRES: 12-5-35 (formerly Ac 302.01)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ac100-500.html"
